{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pet Desktop Adventure is your good company when you are working. Join a great adventure with your pets on your deskrop. You will facing waves and waves of enemies, take a good care of your pets, form an adventure team and stop your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983950/extras/d619d76420ef487d00f434dc10e57196.avif?t=1753781701\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect coins and decorate your base with different decorations. Some have special functions that will help you take care of your pets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983950/extras/08b242091702526d587c7ea6ba71ea3d.avif?t=1753781701\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will find mysterious eggs after winning a battle. Collect new animals and form a unstopable adventure team!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983950/extras/7b62dc9f3b0c2d9eab17d506697c6e32.avif?t=1753781701\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1983950?t=1753781701","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1983950?t=1753781701","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983950/b37e6439ae14df58cca1781478bd42463e2d9942/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753781701","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1983950/b37e6439ae14df58cca1781478bd42463e2d9942/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753781701","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable witho